msgctxt "308"
msgid "I loooove karaoke! I dunno what I'm gonna sing first..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "I'm gonna go with one of my favorite songs, \"Summer Memories\"! Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr "Mi sembra una buona idea."

msgctxt "344"
msgid "I wonder who's got the high score!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Awww, you're leaving? Aren't you gonna sing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "That was sooo much fun! I just love singing with you! Hehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "C'mon, you've gotta sing, too! Pleeease? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "I'll sing \"Kamurocho Lullaby,\" then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Oh, I know that one! It's one of my favorites! ♪"
msgstr "Oh, questa la conosco! È una delle mie preferite!"

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Not right now."
msgstr "Non adesso."

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"Aww, really? I was really looking forward to hearing you sing, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Kiryu-san... I'm starting to think you don't have a sense of rhythm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Sorry."
msgstr "Scusa."

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Wow, you're actually pretty good! You sounded so cool!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "Saaay... Have you been practicing by yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "Of course not."
msgstr "Certo che no."

msgctxt "512"
msgid "Hehehe, just imagining you practicing all by yourself makes me giggle!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Hahaha... Is that so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "Aww, don't worry about it! It's okay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Thanks..."
msgstr "Grazie..."

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"Wow! That was soooo cool! You really got into it! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "C'mon, you've gotta sing, too! Pleeease? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
